      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishm ent o f Board. There is established, effective April 22,  \n1988, a board of three members to be appointed b y  the President to investigate  \nthis dispute. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any  \norganization of railroad employees or any carrier. The board shall perform its  \nfunctions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2066,
      "char_start": 1923,
