      "text": "Sec. 4. Expiration.  The board shall terminate upon the submission of the  \nreport provided for in Section 2 of this Order.\nEditorial note: For the text of a White House announcement, dated April 20, on the labor dispute, \nsee the W eek ly  C om p ilation  o f  P res id en tia l D ocum ents (vol. 24, no. 16)."
